  "body": "6.7.2 The drag data store\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#the-drag-data-store\r\n\r\nIs 'Plain Unicode string' defined somewhere as a term? Or is the meaning just 'a plain text Unicode string' (ie. a sequence of Unicode code points)? \r\n\r\nIs it acceptable to include escaped characters, and if so, how?",
